    "methodologyNote": "The current 3.9-month figure is calculated as $21.4bn of SBP-held reserves divided by $5.47bn, the trailing 12-month average of SBP monthly goods imports through 2026-08. It therefore measures goods-import cover and may differ from official or IMF measures that use broader imports or reserve-adequacy methods. Only historical points supported by archived inputs are retained.",
